--- !u!114 &653791394
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 653791393}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3d856ddf8798a4069a553cc142dbb3da, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::EndingManager
  backgroundImage: {fileID: 513842796}
  endingTitle: {fileID: 290129894}
  endingText: {fileID: 1477044204}
  musicSource: {fileID: 1469963903}
  returnButton: {fileID: 159450639}
  endings:
  - id: 0
    background: {fileID: 274689048772796344, guid: a1e8729eebb2240e098bd06226620705, type: 3}
    title: Ending
    text: The Story Ends...
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7232a730f29bf8c4d80b29c61ef4aa4d, type: 3}
  - id: 1
    background: {fileID: -7600818536511417250, guid: f6b589acf47574f0d9a0b03a6488ff85, type: 3}
    title: The City That Grew from Trees
    text: "You slay the dragon. Crowds greet you as the city's savior. Weeks later,
      the forest becomes a city, and every villager now has a home. Only then do
      you learn: the dragon never burned the forest\u2014the mayor did. When the
      city rose, what was buried beneath it? "
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46790f1959313431e8dd5947b5791bf8, type: 3}
  - id: 2
    background: {fileID: 8053752983816758155, guid: 11b3205ffb8b348de9f2967d66b6d80a, type: 3}
    title: Echo of the Dragon
    text: You fall, and the world fades to black. The villagers whisper that the
      dragon devours those who hum off-key. No one remembers how the rumors began,
      yet the town keeps singing them, louder with each passing day. The mayor only
      smiles beneath the new streetlights, standing where the forest once grew.
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a439a321d8f604fe3bc95dffd4f8e3b3, type: 3}
  - id: 3
    background: {fileID: 2123476621799510338, guid: e3473cdb12f2d4ef2b625f56b18e2a37, type: 3}
    title: The Cold Aftermath
    text: "You end the mayor\u2019s rule, believing justice done. Winter comes, and
      the roofs stay cold\u2014without his administration, the shelters never finish.
      Many homeless from the town perish in the harsh winter. Did you save the forest,
      or trade lives for silence? "
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 430301a870a6e448ab58f6af1d1c9b2f, type: 3}
  - id: 4
    background: {fileID: 2936200337113804969, guid: c5005a5520d2e41f78ed9a17afc4c8a6, type: 3}
    title: 'The Silent Conquest  '
    text: 'Your revolt fails. As you languish in a cell, you hear that a new city
      is rising where the old forest once stood. Homeless villagers find shelters
      there, but nature is gone. '
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 36fbe40b52a0544fc8fd0f9af7212134, type: 3}
  - id: 5
    background: {fileID: -9129279613613654666, guid: 0719e321be46f40c6ac58dc86fabbfac, type: 3}
    title: Legends of the Wanderer
    text: "The new city rose beside the forest, its lights mingling with fireflies.
      People slept warm beneath roofs; deers roamed where sunlight flickered through
      branches. The dragon's name was spoken with awe\u2014a guardian beyond the
      edge, honored but never seen. The mayor looked on in quiet relief, knowing
      the land was at peace. "
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5687c638df75f4f3b8f4c85f65063443, type: 3}
  - id: 6
    background: {fileID: -7329291074463338820, guid: 5309c9132179a483889b974e850015a4, type: 3}
    title: The Golden Zoo
    text: "The mayor bows to your persistence. Soon, the animals find refuge\u2014behind
      fences and tickets, inside the new city zoo. The people applaud, the press
      calls it progress. But as the gates clang shut, your triumph sounds strangely
      hollow. "
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93b956f536c9248d4b1fe01610cc6b1b, type: 3}
  - id: 7
    background: {fileID: 274689048772796344, guid: a1e8729eebb2240e098bd06226620705, type: 3}
    title: Fading Footsteps
    text: 'You leave in silence. The mayor thanks you for your concern, voice even
      and courteous. Outside, the wind carries a scent of burnt cedar. Nothing changes,
      except your understanding of how power smiles. '
    music: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5c2a2df58a7824455b6c769fce6a8782, type: 3}
  lettersPerSecond: 20
